    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to wishlist</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/81bb9187be89e873a0bfbe5f960bad76.avif?t=1714463320\" /></div><br><br>My Hotel: Echoes of the Past! Welcome to the intrigue of the 1950s, where mystery cloaks every corner of My Hotel. Remember - this is a free trial. Ensure you're in the loop by adding the game to your Steam Wishlist for the full, thrilling story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.poster.avif?t=1714463320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.webm?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.mp4?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>You've just landed the role of a lifetime: owner of a hotel that's seen better days. It's like stepping into a 1950s adventure movie \u2013 the previous owner's mysterious end, a hotel riddled with secrets, and now, it's all yours.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.poster.avif?t=1714463320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.webm?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.mp4?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Your quest: to transform this relic into a beacon of style and history. Choose from a range of furnishings that span decades, each with its own story to tell.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/1f9b9deb3ee9814d29a137ba689f9e97.poster.avif?t=1714463320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/1f9b9deb3ee9814d29a137ba689f9e97.webm?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/1f9b9deb3ee9814d29a137ba689f9e97.mp4?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>But it's not just about the d\u00e9cor. The guests are as varied as they are mysterious, some with quests that will draw you into a tangle of alliances and covert affairs.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/07ed132e217e3be009e221da92eeffa5.avif?t=1714463320\" /></div><br><br><strong>Balance these factions carefully to keep your hotel thriving and avoid a fate like your predecessor's. It's a game where adventure meets history, and every decision you make is a part of the legend.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/81bb9187be89e873a0bfbe5f960bad76.avif?t=1714463320\" /></div><br><br>My Hotel: Echoes of the Past! Welcome to the intrigue of the 1950s, where mystery cloaks every corner of My Hotel. Remember - this is a free trial. Ensure you're in the loop by adding the game to your Steam Wishlist for the full, thrilling story.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.poster.avif?t=1714463320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.webm?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/8db62377bf88aabbce1b1179fc27ef13.mp4?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>You've just landed the role of a lifetime: owner of a hotel that's seen better days. It's like stepping into a 1950s adventure movie \u2013 the previous owner's mysterious end, a hotel riddled with secrets, and now, it's all yours.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.poster.avif?t=1714463320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.webm?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2080210/extras/3d31d9e87b46ad625c159077e99b2b8e.mp4?t=1714463320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Your quest: to transform this relic into a bea